			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750013301,
					"content": "奇怪，为什么那些金色花纹同样都已经飘过去了…在这里的柱子底下却没有出现「镌光铭印」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013302,
					"content": "说明这里的「镌光铭印」不仅被挤压出来，还变得不完整了…这下可麻烦了，还得找到分散在他处的「镌光铭印」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013303,
					"content": "所以那个分散在其他地方的「镌光铭印」在哪里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013304,
					"content": "…我也不知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013305,
					"content": "欸…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013306,
					"content": "虽然分散，但是毕竟仍然是受到力量的约束，所以应该就在附近才对，或许需要找找…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013307,
					"content": "呀，呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013308,
					"content": "#怎么了，你想去那边？现在{NICKNAME}和我们有更重要的事要做，待会儿再陪你玩好不好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013309,
					"content": "嗯…呀！呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013310,
					"content": "意思是，铭印在那边吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013311,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013312,
					"content": "哎呀，听说就算到了现在，也有龙能够感应「镌光铭印」的力量，以前一直以为是传言，没想到也许是真的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013313,
					"content": "#果然{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}不是一只普通的小嵴锋龙啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013314,
					"content": "原来你还有这种本事呀，哼，不过比起我这个向导，还是有不小的差距的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013315,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013316,
						750013318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013316,
					"content": "派蒙在嫉妒你哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013317
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013317,
					"content": "哪有，我的心胸可比看上去宽广多了！这、这只是我夸奖的一种方式啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013320,
					"content": "嗯…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013321,
					"content": "唉，这个小家伙根本没听懂嘛，真是的，如果能再聪明一点就好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013322,
					"content": "总有它能够听懂的时刻的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013323
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013323,
					"content": "是啊，而且部族里负责看顾龙的人们都说，想要和龙达成情感上的互通，是要花上很长很长时间的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013324,
					"content": "而能跟龙打成一片的秘诀是：耐心与持续不断地交流。不管是人想去理解龙，还是龙想要理解人，都需要…需要很长的时间哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013325,
					"content": "#是呢…就像刚才我也没有意识到{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}想要向我们说什么一样呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013326,
					"content": "#对不起哦，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013327,
					"content": "嗯，呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013328,
					"content": "你这倒是应得很快！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013329,
					"content": "好啦，那就朝着你刚才想去的地方，去找找看有没有那种金色花纹吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013318,
					"content": "派蒙在夸奖你啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013319
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013319,
					"content": "是夸奖没错，不过一定不能因此骄傲自大…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}